OL,5,G0020 Yuja x Hockney at Lightroom London
OL,6,     FAt the Lightroom in London,
OL,7,     Fpianist Yuja Wang offers an
OL,8,     Fextraordinary recital at the heart
OL,9,     Fof the immersive exhibition
OL,10,     Fdevoted to David Hockney.
OL,11,G0140 Academy Of Ancient Music:
OL,12,G     Vivaldi's Four Seasons
OL,13,     FEnjoy the sounds of wintery
OL,14,     Fblizzards and summer days in
OL,15,     FVivaldi's popular work, performed
OL,16,     Fhere by the Academy of Ancient
OL,17,     FMusic and violinist Rachel Podger.
